<title>USA: Toyota September US car sales rise.</title>
<headline>Toyota September US car sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyota Motor Corp</p>
<p>			Sep 1-30, 1996     Sep 1-30, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    38,420	    35,958	    +11.3</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  13,530	     9,538	    +47.8</p>
<p> Import Car		18,180	    20,409	     -7.2</p>
<p> Import Truck	    14,961	    11,730	    +32.9</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Sep 30, 1996 Jan 1-Sep 30, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   423,827	   375,221	    +12.5</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	 109,682	    78,889	    +38.4</p>
<p> Import Car	     186,615	   229,249	    -18.9</p>
<p> Import Truck	   165,388	   140,307	    +17.4</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 24 in latest month vs 25, 231 for year to date vs 230 in year ago.</p>
</text>
